T1lib
=====

Since version 1:5.1.23-4, grace uses an embedded and statically linked copy of
a portion of T1lib for some rendering tasks.  No shared library is provided.
The included T1lib code can be treated as a part of the grace distribution.
Please note that it is not a *full* copy of the original T1lib source, only the
license and the subcomponents of the original tree needed for grace.

Bugs in the T1lib implementation included in the grace source tree, and that
are relevant to grace's operation, will be dealt with like any other grace bug.
The included T1lib code should *not* be used in other projects; if you really
need the shared library (e.g. to support other old software not in the Debian
archive), you should instead investigate the old versions still available at
<http://snapshot.debian.org/package/t1lib/>; the most recent version available
there should be considered better (in a relative sense!) for use as a shared
library.  Additionally, it contains the full upstream distribution, which grace
does not.

New projects should most certainly not use T1lib at all.

